==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|kalp}}, from {{inh|de|goh|kalb}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*kalb}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*kalbaz}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*gʷolbʰo-||womb, animal young}}. Compare {{cog|nl|kalf}}, {{cog|en|calf}}, {{cog|da|kalv}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/kalp/}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-Kalb.ogg|a=Austria}}
* {{audio|de|De-Kalb.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n,(e)s,^er|dim=^chen,^lein|f=^in}}

# [[calf]] (young cow)

